WEBVTT

00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:07.662
Ikeja Hardware drafts an order to Lagos Industrial, priced at its own terms.

00:00:07.662 --> 00:00:15.036
It submits the order. Lagos Industrial hears of it at once.

00:00:15.036 --> 00:00:23.004
Lagos Industrial accepts: the stock is reserved for Ikeja Hardware.

00:00:23.004 --> 00:00:35.816
It picks and packs from what was reserved, then dispatches with a tracking reference.

00:00:35.816 --> 00:00:42.980
Delivered, with the signed delivery note as proof. The invoice was issued on dispatch.

00:00:42.980 --> 00:00:51.065
Ikeja Hardware confirms it received the goods.

00:00:51.065 --> 00:00:57.540
It pays by bank transfer and tells Lagos Industrial, with the bank reference.

00:00:57.540 --> 00:01:06.549
Lagos Industrial checks its bank and confirms: the invoice is paid and the order complete.
